      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T14:27:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes: https://g3doc.corp.google.com/company/teams/opensource/copyright.md?cl\u003dhead#the-year\n\nInterestingly, those suggest (if anything) extending the range of years as files are edited. I think our usual policy fits with what\u0027s described, though - when a \"new\" file is created (and isn\u0027t a pure copy/move), start with the current year. After that, don\u0027t update it.",
      "parentUuid": "343b3d54_f4d338f0",
      "revId": "ba4934f5d7167ba95939573c20be12105a6d98fa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
